LibreYOLO adapts the native HRNet pose graph, affine person-crop geometry,
heatmap decoding, flip restoration, and OKS suppression. LibreYOLO-specific
factory, detector-adapter, result, validation, and export integration is new
integration code. See docs/provenance/hrnet.md for the exact source mapping,
checkpoint hashes, and numerical evidence.

